n aldeano y se hace de noche.","objective":"Sugiere construir un refugio y di que estás de acuerdo con su idea.","starter":"It's getting dark. What do you think we should do?","minTurns":3},{"type":"speak","instruction":"Repite la pregunta","say":"Why don't we explore the cave?","prompt":"Haz una sugerencia."},{"type":"speak","instruction":"Repite","say":"In my opinion, we should plant wheat.","prompt":"Comparte tu opinión."},{"type":"conversation","instruction":"Pequeña conversación","scenario":"Tu amigo quiere fabricar armadura antes de pelear con los mobs.","objective":"Di tu opinión, muestra acuerdo o desacuerdo y propón un plan.","starter":"I believe that we should craft armor. Do you agree?","minTurns":3},{"type":"speak","instruction":"Repite la oración condicional","say":"If we share resources, everyone will survive.","prompt":"Anima a tu equipo."}]},{"skill":"pronunciation","title":"Pronunciation","xp":25,"exercises":[{"type":"multi_select","instruction":"Selecciona solo las palabras con el sonido /b/","sound":"/b/","options":[{"text":"build","correct":true},{"text":"believe","correct":true},{"text":"about","correct":true},{"text":"think","correct":false},{"text":"share","correct":false},{"text":"explore","correct":false}]},{"type":"speak","instruction":"Repite y cuida el sonido /θ/","say":"I think we should explore.","prompt":"Saca la lengua para la 'th'."},{"type":"multi_select","instruction":"Selecciona solo las palabras con el sonido /s/","sound":"/s/","options":[{"text":"shelter","correct":true},{"text":"resources","correct":true},{"text":"survive","correct":true},{"text":"build","correct":false},{"text":"wheat","correct":false},{"text":"agree","correct":false}]},{"type":"speak","instruction":"Repite y cuida el sonido /r/","say":"We should craft armor.","prompt":"Marca bien la 'r'."},{"type":"speak","instruction":"Repite y cuida el sonido /aɪ/","say":"In my opinion, I agree.","prompt":"Pronuncia clara la 'i' larga."}]}]}